WEBVTT

00:04:57.339 --> 00:05:00.908
to execute projects
with changing requirements

00:05:00.932 --> 00:05:03.304
to achieve progressive results

00:05:03.328 --> 00:05:04.542
in increments.

00:05:06.003 --> 00:05:09.891
We needed to deliver quick results,

00:05:09.915 --> 00:05:11.106
and in pieces,

00:05:11.869 --> 00:05:17.421
considering our work was largely
dependent on Lubuto's responsiveness

00:05:17.445 --> 00:05:18.820
and capability.

00:05:19.414 --> 00:05:23.443
The first team member I acquired
was my beautiful wife Abigail,

00:05:23.467 --> 00:05:26.239
who is luckily a project manager, too.

00:05:27.207 --> 00:05:29.511
You know how rough that can be, right?